<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Team Invitation</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; padding: 20px; }
    .card { background: #1e293b; border-radius: 8px; padding: 30px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; border: 1px solid #334155; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #6C63FF; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; }
    .role-tag { background: #334155; color: #3ECFCF; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; }
    .warning { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 15px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>You are Invited to Join {{teamName}}!</h2>
    <p><strong>{{inviterName}}</strong> has invited you to collaborate on the <strong>{{teamName}}</strong> workspace on QuickLink URL Shortener.</p>
    <p>You have been assigned the role: <span class="role-tag">{{role}}</span></p>
    <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" class="btn">Accept Invitation</a>
    <p class="warning">⚠️ This invitation link will expire in 7 days.</p>
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #334155; margin: 25px 0;">
    <h4>What is QuickLink Teams?</h4>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #94a3b8;">QuickLink Teams allows organizations to create, manage, track, and analyze custom short URLs collaboratively in a single shared dashboard.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
